{
  "title": "08 — Twitch Chat Activity",
  "uid": "twitch-chat-activity",
  "tags": ["tripbot", "product", "twitch"],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-24h", "to": "now" },

  "templating": { "list": [ { "name": "platform", "label": "Platform", "type": "query", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__" }, "query": "label_values(target_info{service_namespace=\"tripbot\"}, service_platform)", "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" }, "includeAll": true, "allValue": ".*", "multi": true, "refresh": 2, "sort": 1 }, { "name": "deployment_environment", "type": "query", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__" }, "query": "label_values(target_info{service_name=\"tripbot\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"}, deployment_environment)", "current": { "text": "prod-1", "value": "prod-1" }, "includeAll": true, "multi": false, "refresh": 2, "sort": 1 } ] },"panels": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 62, "w": 24, "h": 3 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "These metrics populate when tripbot is receiving Twitch chat over gateway-twitch and messages are flowing. If panels look empty, check `kubectl logs deploy/gateway-twitch` for failing `inbound_chat` requests, and verify gateway-twitch's Twitch token is still valid. **Twitch Helix metrics are not here** — the platform-gateway is the single Helix caller, so rate-budget and Helix-error panels live on the Service Health / platform-gateway dashboard under its Twitch Helix row. The custom counters live in `pkg/instrumentation/tripbot.go` (`tripbot_chat_messages`, `tripbot_chat_commands{command=...}`, `twitch_subscribers_total`, `twitch_followers_total`). Subs/followers are gauges refreshed by the 5-min cron in `cmd/tripbot/tripbot.go`. **Operations row** (added 2026-05-15): `tripbot_command_duration_seconds{command=...}` for per-command latency, `tripbot_events_total{event=...,service_platform=...}` for the events-table write rate — every kind in the taxonomy, not just login/logout, `tripbot_scoreboard_writes_total{scoreboard=...}` for monthly miles/guesses write rate. **Chat feed row** (added 2026-05-15): each chat message arrives as a Loki log record under `{service_name=\"tripbot\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\", scope_name=\"twitch-chat\"}` with `twitch.user` + `twitch.channel` as attributes — replaces the retired Stackdriver path (see [tripbot#540](https://github.com/adanalife/tripbot/pull/540))."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Subscribers",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 4, "h": 5 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "max by (deployment_environment) (twitch_subscribers_total{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"})" , "legendFormat": "[{{deployment_environment}}]" }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Followers",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 4, "y": 0, "w": 4, "h": 5 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "max by (deployment_environment) (twitch_followers_total{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"})" , "legendFormat": "[{{deployment_environment}}]" }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Messages / minute",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 8, "y": 0, "w": 4, "h": 5 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (deployment_environment) (rate(tripbot_chat_messages_total{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"}[5m])) * 60" , "legendFormat": "[{{deployment_environment}}]" }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Commands / minute",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 0, "w": 4, "h": 5 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (deployment_environment) (rate(tripbot_chat_commands_total{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"}[5m])) * 60" , "legendFormat": "[{{deployment_environment}}]" }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Messages (24h)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 16, "y": 0, "w": 4, "h": 5 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (deployment_environment) (increase(tripbot_chat_messages_total{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"}[24h]))" , "legendFormat": "[{{deployment_environment}}]" }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Commands (24h)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 20, "y": 0, "w": 4, "h": 5 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (deployment_environment) (increase(tripbot_chat_commands_total{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"}[24h]))" , "legendFormat": "[{{deployment_environment}}]" }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Subscribers & followers over time",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 22, "w": 24, "h": 10 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "max by (deployment_environment) (twitch_followers_total{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"})", "legendFormat": "followers [{{deployment_environment}}]" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "max by (deployment_environment) (twitch_subscribers_total{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"})", "legendFormat": "subscribers [{{deployment_environment}}]" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "spanNulls": true } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Chat messages over time",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 13, "w": 12, "h": 9 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (deployment_environment) (rate(tripbot_chat_messages_total{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"}[5m])) * 60", "legendFormat": "msgs / min [{{deployment_environment}}]" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 20 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Commands over time (top 10)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 13, "w": 12, "h": 9 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "topk(10, sum by (command, deployment_environment) (rate(tripbot_chat_commands_total{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"}[5m]))) * 60", "legendFormat": "{{command}} [{{deployment_environment}}]" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 50, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Top commands (1h)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 5, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "topk(15, sum by (command, deployment_environment) (increase(tripbot_chat_commands_total{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"}[1h])))", "legendFormat": "{{command}} [{{deployment_environment}}]" }
      ],
      "options": { "orientation": "horizontal", "displayMode": "gradient", "showUnfilled": true, "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Operations",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 32, "w": 24, "h": 1 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Events / min (all kinds)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 33, "w": 8, "h": 5 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (deployment_environment) (rate(tripbot_events_total{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"}[5m])) * 60" , "legendFormat": "[{{deployment_environment}}]" }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Scoreboard writes / min",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 8, "y": 33, "w": 8, "h": 5 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (deployment_environment) (rate(tripbot_scoreboard_writes_total{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"}[5m])) * 60" , "legendFormat": "[{{deployment_environment}}]" }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Command p95 (all)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 16, "y": 33, "w": 8, "h": 5 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, deployment_environment) (rate(tripbot_command_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"}[$__rate_interval])))" , "legendFormat": "[{{deployment_environment}}]" }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Command latency (p50 / p95 / p99)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 38, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, deployment_environment) (rate(tripbot_command_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"}[$__rate_interval])))", "legendFormat": "p50 [{{deployment_environment}}]" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, deployment_environment) (rate(tripbot_command_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"}[$__rate_interval])))", "legendFormat": "p95 [{{deployment_environment}}]" },
        { "refId": "C", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, deployment_environment) (rate(tripbot_command_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"}[$__rate_interval])))", "legendFormat": "p99 [{{deployment_environment}}]" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Command p95 by command (top 10)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 38, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "topk(10, histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, command, deployment_environment) (rate(tripbot_command_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"}[$__rate_interval]))))", "legendFormat": "{{command}} [{{deployment_environment}}]" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 5 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Event rate by kind",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 46, "w": 24, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (event, deployment_environment) (rate(tripbot_events_total{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"}[5m])) * 60", "legendFormat": "{{event}} / min [{{deployment_environment}}]" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Scoreboard writes by scoreboard",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 54, "w": 24, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (scoreboard, deployment_environment) (rate(tripbot_scoreboard_writes_total{service_name=\"tripbot\", service_platform=~\"$platform\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"}[5m])) * 60", "legendFormat": "{{scoreboard}} [{{deployment_environment}}]" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Chat feed (live)",
      "description": "Twitch chat messages as they arrive, rendered as `username: message` for live-chat scannability. Emitted by pkg/chatbot/log/log.go as OTel log records under scope_name=\"twitch-chat\"; twitch.user and twitch.channel arrive as structured metadata.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "__DS_LOKI__" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 5, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "{service_name=\"tripbot\", deployment_environment=~\"$deployment_environment\"} | service_platform=~\"$platform\" | scope_name=\"twitch-chat\" | line_format \"{{ __timestamp__ | date \\\"15:04:05\\\" }} {{ .twitch_user }}: {{ __line__ }}\" | drop scope_name, twitch_channel, twitch_user, detected_level" }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Ascending",
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": false,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "showLogContextToggle": false
      }
    }
  ]
}
